@baseUrl = http://localhost:4001

### Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Registreren
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "fan2024",
  "email": "fan2024@example.com",
  "firstName": "Voornaam",
  "lastName": "Achternaam",
  "password": "Wachtwoord123!",
  "userStatus": "Active",
  "userRole": "User"
}

### Inloggen
POST {{baseUrl}}/userSessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "_username": "fan2024",
  "_password": "Wachtwoord123!"
}

### Abonnement afsluiten
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscription
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "fan2024",
  "artistname": "artiest01",
  "subscriptionType": "Basic"
}

### Abonnementen ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscription/fan2024

### Abonnementstatus wijzigen
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/subscription/fan2024
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "artistname": "artiest01",
  "subscriptionType": "Basic"
}

### Posts van een artiest ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?artistName=artiest01

### Contactformulier versturen
POST {{baseUrl}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "_username": "fan2024",
  "_message": "Ik heb een vraag over mijn abonnement."
}

### Contactberichten ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/contact

### Status van een contactbericht wijzigen
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formTime": "2024-01-01 12:00:00",
  "username": "fan2024",
  "messageStatus": "Resolved"
}
